<title>BELGIUM: Brussels bourse start delayed for third day.</title>
<headline>Brussels bourse start delayed for third day.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels forward market started about 13 minutes late on Wednesday due to a minor technical problem, its third delayed opening in a row.</p>
<p>The Bel-20 index started slightly lower at 1,754.62 against Tuesday's close of 1,755.62.</p>
<p>The start of trade was delayed by 12 minutes on Monday and by nearly half an hour on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
